{
 "title": "Iron and peanuts",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Iron and peanuts",
   "card": false,
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "c271",
     "shot": "ir_turner",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Freedom changed everything, fast.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c272",
     "shot": "ir_turner",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Within five years, Alabama sent its first Black",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c273",
     "shot": "ir_turner",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "congressman to Washington, Benjamin Turner of Selma.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:Turner",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c274",
     "shot": "ir_turner",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "He had been born enslaved.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c275",
     "shot": "ir_turner",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "It did not last.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:last.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c276",
     "shot": "ir_const",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "By 1901, white leaders wrote a new state",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c277",
     "shot": "ir_const",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "constitution.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c278",
     "shot": "ir_const",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "They did not hide why.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c279",
     "shot": "ir_const",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The man in charge of the convention told",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c280",
     "shot": "ir_const",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the delegates the goal was, quote, to establish",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c281",
     "shot": "ir_const",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "white supremacy in this state.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c282",
     "shot": "ir_const",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Poll taxes and literacy tests followed, and the",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:Poll",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c283",
     "shot": "ir_const",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "voting rolls emptied.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c284",
     "shot": "ir_const",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Most Black Alabamians and many poor white Alabamians",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c285",
     "shot": "ir_const",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "lost the vote.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c286",
     "shot": "ir_const",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And that constitution was amended so many times,",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       "w:amended",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c287",
     "shot": "ir_const",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "nearly a thousand times, that it became the",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c288",
     "shot": "ir_const",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "longest constitution in the world.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:longest",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c289",
     "shot": "ir_const",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Seriously, it's longer than most novels.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boing",
       "w:novels.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c290",
     "shot": "ir_iron",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But underground, something else was waiting.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c291",
     "shot": "ir_iron",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Near the middle of the state, there's a",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c292",
     "shot": "ir_iron",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "ridge called Red Mountain.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c293",
     "shot": "ir_iron",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "It turned out to hold iron ore.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "swish",
       "w:iron",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c294",
     "shot": "ir_iron",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Right next to it, coal.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "swish",
       "w:coal.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c295",
     "shot": "ir_iron",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And next to that, limestone.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "swish",
       "w:limestone.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c296",
     "shot": "ir_iron",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Iron ore, coal, and limestone are the three",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c297",
     "shot": "ir_iron",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "things you need to make iron.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "anvil",
       "w:iron.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c298",
     "shot": "ir_iron",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Finding all three in one place is incredibly",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c299",
     "shot": "ir_iron",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "rare.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:rare.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c300",
     "shot": "ir_magic",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "So in 1871, investors built a brand new",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c301",
     "shot": "ir_magic",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "city right on top of them, and named",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c302",
     "shot": "ir_magic",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "it after the great English industrial city, Birmingham.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:Birmingham.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c303",
     "shot": "ir_magic",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "It grew so fast that people called it",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c304",
     "shot": "ir_magic",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "the Magic City.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c305",
     "shot": "ir_vulcan",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "To show off, Birmingham cast a giant iron",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c306",
     "shot": "ir_vulcan",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "statue of Vulcan, the Roman god of the",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "clang",
       "w:Vulcan,",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c307",
     "shot": "ir_vulcan",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "forge, for the 1904 World's Fair.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c308",
     "shot": "ir_vulcan",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "56 feet tall.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c309",
     "shot": "ir_vulcan",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Still the largest cast iron statue in the",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c310",
     "shot": "ir_vulcan",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "world.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c311",
     "shot": "ir_vulcan",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "When the fair ended, Birmingham couldn't pay the",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "kaching",
       "w:pay",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c312",
     "shot": "ir_vulcan",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "shipping bill, so the god of the forge",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c313",
     "shot": "ir_vulcan",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "was dumped in pieces beside the railroad tracks.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "clang",
       "w:pieces",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c314",
     "shot": "ir_vulcan",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Today he stands on top of Red Mountain,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c315",
     "shot": "ir_vulcan",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "with his bare backside pointed straight at the",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boing",
       "w:backside",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c316",
     "shot": "ir_vulcan",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "neighboring suburb.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c317",
     "shot": "ir_lease",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "But the Magic City had a dark engine",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c318",
     "shot": "ir_lease",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "room.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c319",
     "shot": "ir_lease",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Thousands of Black men were arrested for tiny",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c320",
     "shot": "ir_lease",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "offenses like vagrancy, and then leased out to",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c321",
     "shot": "ir_lease",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "coal mines and work camps as prisoners.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c322",
     "shot": "ir_lease",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "They worked in terrible conditions.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c323",
     "shot": "ir_lease",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Many died.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c324",
     "shot": "ir_lease",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Alabama was the last state to end this",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c325",
     "shot": "ir_lease",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "system in 1928.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c326",
     "shot": "ir_carver",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Meanwhile, in the town of Tuskegee, a former",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c327",
     "shot": "ir_carver",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "slave named Booker T.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c328",
     "shot": "ir_carver",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Washington had opened a school for Black students.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c329",
     "shot": "ir_carver",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 1896, he hired a quiet scientist named",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c330",
     "shot": "ir_carver",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "George Washington Carver.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c331",
     "shot": "ir_carver",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Carver looked at the tired cotton fields and",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c332",
     "shot": "ir_carver",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "said, plant peanuts.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:peanuts.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c333",
     "shot": "ir_carver",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "They put goodness back into the soil.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c334",
     "shot": "ir_carver",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Then he found hundreds of uses for them.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c335",
     "shot": "ir_carver",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Dyes, milk, plastics, cosmetics.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "tick",
       "w:Dyes,",
       0.5
      ],
      [
       "tick",
       "w:milk,",
       0.5
      ],
      [
       "tick",
       "w:plastics,",
       0.5
      ],
      [
       "tick",
       "w:cosmetics.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c336",
     "shot": "ir_carver",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And no, he did not invent peanut butter.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:peanut",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c337",
     "shot": "ir_carver",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Sorry.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boing",
       0,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c338",
     "shot": "ir_carver",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Farmers did not want to listen.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c339",
     "shot": "ir_carver",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Cotton was money.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c340",
     "shot": "ir_weevil",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Then in the 1910s, a tiny beetle crawled",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "c341",
     "shot": "ir_weevil",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "in from Mexico.",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "c342",
     "shot": "ir_weevil",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The boll weevil.",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "birds",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       "w:weevil.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c343",
     "shot": "ir_weevil",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "It ate the cotton.",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "c344",
     "shot": "ir_weevil",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Field after field, whole counties were ruined.",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "c345",
     "shot": "ir_weevil",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "So in the town of Enterprise, the farmers",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "c346",
     "shot": "ir_weevil",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "finally switched to peanuts.",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "birds",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:peanuts.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c347",
     "shot": "ir_weevil",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And they started making more money than they",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "c348",
     "shot": "ir_weevil",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "ever had from cotton.",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "c349",
     "shot": "ir_monument",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "So in 1919, the grateful people of Enterprise",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c350",
     "shot": "ir_monument",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "did something no town on earth had ever",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c351",
     "shot": "ir_monument",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "done.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c352",
     "shot": "ir_monument",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "They built a monument.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:monument.",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c353",
     "shot": "ir_monument",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "To the bug.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:bug.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c354",
     "shot": "ir_monument",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "It's still there, in the main street.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c355",
     "shot": "ir_monument",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "A woman holding a giant boll weevil over",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c356",
     "shot": "ir_monument",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "her head.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c357",
     "shot": "ir_monument",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The only monument in the world to an",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:only",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c358",
     "shot": "ir_monument",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "agricultural pest.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c359",
     "shot": "ir_wright",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And just one more.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c360",
     "shot": "ir_wright",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 1910, the Wright brothers came to an",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:Wright",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c361",
     "shot": "ir_wright",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "old cotton plantation outside Montgomery and opened America's",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c362",
     "shot": "ir_wright",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "first civilian flying school.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c363",
     "shot": "ir_wright",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Their students made the first night flights in",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c364",
     "shot": "ir_wright",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "history.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c365",
     "shot": "ir_wright",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Alabama farmers were watching airplanes before most Americans",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c366",
     "shot": "ir_wright",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "had ever seen one.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c367",
     "shot": "ir_keller",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And the people.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c368",
     "shot": "ir_keller",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Alabama kept producing people the whole world would",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c369",
     "shot": "ir_keller",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "know.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c370",
     "shot": "ir_keller",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 1880, in the town of Tuscumbia, a",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c371",
     "shot": "ir_keller",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "baby girl was born who would lose her",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c372",
     "shot": "ir_keller",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "sight and her hearing before she was two.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c373",
     "shot": "ir_keller",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Years later, at a water pump in her",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c374",
     "shot": "ir_keller",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "family's garden, her teacher spelled a word into",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c375",
     "shot": "ir_keller",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "her hand, over and over, while cold water",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c376",
     "shot": "ir_keller",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "ran across the other one.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c377",
     "shot": "ir_keller",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "W-A-T-E-R.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "tick",
       0,
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "tick",
       8,
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "tick",
       16,
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "tick",
       24,
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "tick",
       32,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c378",
     "shot": "ir_keller",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "That was the moment Helen Keller understood that",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:Helen",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c379",
     "shot": "ir_keller",
     "type": "HOST",
